{
  "format": "misaka.palw.model-adapter.v1",
  "id": "mobilenet-v2",
  "kind": "cnn",
  "doc": "MobileNetV2 (MobileNetV2Model and the base of MobileNetV2ForImageClassification; google/mobilenet_v2_*): a 3x3 stride-2 stem convolution to 32 channels, the stem's own depthwise 3x3 and linear 1x1 reduction, sixteen inverted-residual blocks (a 1x1 expansion to `expand_ratio` times the width, a depthwise 3x3 at the block's stride, a LINEAR 1x1 reduction; the input added when the stride is 1 and the width unchanged), a final 1x1 convolution; every convolution has its batch norm (folded exactly: BN_FOLD_V1) and ReLU6 except the reductions. ReLU6 is a narrowing into its fixed unit 6/32767 whose clamp is the activation (ACT_CLAMP_FIXED_UNIT_V1); TensorFlow 'SAME' padding (tf_padding, the default) is the window table's asymmetric padding computed from the input's extent (CONV_PAD_TF_SAME_V1). Channel counts follow HF's make_divisible(round(c * depth_multiplier)). The output is the pooled vector (global average pooling, `pooler_output`). A dilated variant (output_stride 8 or 16, DeepLab's backbone) is refused by name. Written as data only. Features: CNN_FROM_SPEC_V1, CONV_DENSE_V1, CONV_DEPTHWISE_2D_V1, BN_FOLD_V1, CONV_PAD_TF_SAME_V1, ACT_CLAMP_FIXED_UNIT_V1, RESIDUAL_ADD_ACT_V1, POOL_AVG_GLOBAL_V1. `$round` rounds a half away from zero where Python's round goes to even: they differ only at an exact half, which the adapter refuses by name.",
  "match": {"architectures": ["MobileNetV2Model", "MobileNetV2ForImageClassification"], "model_types": ["mobilenet_v2"]},
  "config": {
    "defaults": {"num_channels": 3, "image_size": 224, "depth_multiplier": 1.0, "depth_divisible_by": 8, "min_depth": 8, "expand_ratio": 6.0, "output_stride": 32, "first_layer_is_expansion": true, "finegrained_output": true, "hidden_act": "relu6", "tf_padding": true, "layer_norm_eps": 0.001},
    "inert": ["classifier_dropout_prob", "initializer_range", "semantic_loss_ignore_index", "id2label", "label2id", "num_labels", "problem_type", "is_decoder", "cross_attention_hidden_size", "add_cross_attention", "tie_word_embeddings"]
  },
  "vars": [
    {"name": "nc_ok", "value": {"$check": [{"$eq": [{"$cfg": "num_channels"}, 3]}, "num_channels other than 3 (the class's image is RGB)"]}},
    {"name": "os_ok", "value": {"$check": [{"$eq": [{"$cfg": "output_stride"}, 32]}, "output_stride other than 32 (the dilated backbone is not lowered)"]}},
    {"name": "dm", "value": {"$cfg": "depth_multiplier"}},
    {"name": "dm_ok", "value": {"$check": [{"$gt": [{"$var": "dm"}, 0]}, "depth_multiplier must be positive"]}},
    {"name": "div", "value": {"$cfg": "depth_divisible_by"}},
    {"name": "mind", "value": {"$cfg": "min_depth"}},
    {"name": "ratio", "value": {"$cfg": "expand_ratio"}},
    {"name": "tfp", "value": {"$cfg": "tf_padding"}},
    {"name": "eps", "value": {"$cfg": "layer_norm_eps"}},
    {"name": "act", "value": {"$act": {"$cfg": "hidden_act"}}},
    {"name": "base", "value": [32, 16, 24, 24, 32, 32, 32, 64, 64, 64, 64, 96, 96, 96, 160, 160, 160, 320, 1280]},
    {"name": "scaled", "value": {"$map": [{"$var": "base"}, "c", {"$mul": [{"$var": "c"}, {"$var": "dm"}]}]}},
    {"name": "no_half", "value": {"$check": [{"$eq": [{"$sum": {"$map": [{"$var": "scaled"}, "x", {"$if": [{"$eq": [{"$sub": [{"$var": "x"}, {"$floor": {"$var": "x"}}]}, 0.5]}, 1, 0]}]}}, 0]}, "a depth multiplier that lands on an exact half (Python rounds it to even, the adapter's round away from zero)"]}},
    {"name": "chs", "value": {"$map": [{"$var": "scaled"}, "x",
      {"$let": ["v", {"$round": {"$var": "x"}},
      {"$let": ["nv", {"$max": [{"$var": "mind"}, {"$mul": [{"$idiv": [{"$add": [{"$var": "v"}, {"$idiv": [{"$var": "div"}, 2]}]}, {"$var": "div"}]}, {"$var": "div"}]}]},
      {"$if": [{"$lt": [{"$var": "nv"}, {"$mul": [0.9, {"$var": "v"}]}]}, {"$add": [{"$var": "nv"}, {"$var": "div"}]}, {"$var": "nv"}]}]}]}
    ]}},
    {"name": "head", "value": {"$if": [{"$and": [{"$cfg": "finegrained_output"}, {"$lt": [{"$var": "dm"}, 1.0]}]}, 1280, {"$index": [{"$var": "chs"}, 18]}]}},
    {"name": "strides", "value": [2, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1]},
    {"name": "stem_ch", "value": {"$index": [{"$var": "chs"}, 0]}},
    {"name": "stem", "value": {"$concat": [
      [{"Conv": {"name": "conv_stem.first_conv.convolution", "cin": 3, "cout": {"$var": "stem_ch"}, "k": 3, "stride": 2, "pad": {"$if": [{"$var": "tfp"}, 0, 1]}, "tf_same": {"$var": "tfp"}, "bn": {"name": "conv_stem.first_conv.normalization", "eps": {"$var": "eps"}}, "act": {"$var": "act"}}}],
      {"$if": [{"$cfg": "first_layer_is_expansion"}, [],
        [{"Conv": {"name": "conv_stem.expand_1x1.convolution", "cin": {"$var": "stem_ch"}, "cout": {"$var": "stem_ch"}, "k": 1, "stride": 1, "pad": 0, "bn": {"name": "conv_stem.expand_1x1.normalization", "eps": {"$var": "eps"}}, "act": {"$var": "act"}}}]
      ]},
      [
        {"Conv": {"name": "conv_stem.conv_3x3.convolution", "cin": {"$var": "stem_ch"}, "cout": {"$var": "stem_ch"}, "k": 3, "stride": 1, "pad": {"$if": [{"$var": "tfp"}, 0, 1]}, "tf_same": {"$var": "tfp"}, "groups": {"$var": "stem_ch"}, "bn": {"name": "conv_stem.conv_3x3.normalization", "eps": {"$var": "eps"}}, "act": {"$var": "act"}}},
        {"Conv": {"name": "conv_stem.reduce_1x1.convolution", "cin": {"$var": "stem_ch"}, "cout": {"$index": [{"$var": "chs"}, 1]}, "k": 1, "stride": 1, "pad": 0, "bn": {"name": "conv_stem.reduce_1x1.normalization", "eps": {"$var": "eps"}}, "act": null}}
      ]
    ]}},
    {"name": "blocks", "value": {"$flatten": {"$map": [{"$range": 16}, "i",
      {"$let": ["cin", {"$index": [{"$var": "chs"}, {"$add": [{"$var": "i"}, 1]}]},
      {"$let": ["cout", {"$index": [{"$var": "chs"}, {"$add": [{"$var": "i"}, 2]}]},
      {"$let": ["st", {"$index": [{"$var": "strides"}, {"$var": "i"}]},
      {"$let": ["ex", {"$let": ["w", {"$round": {"$mul": [{"$var": "cin"}, {"$var": "ratio"}]}},
          {"$let": ["nv", {"$max": [{"$var": "mind"}, {"$mul": [{"$idiv": [{"$add": [{"$var": "w"}, {"$idiv": [{"$var": "div"}, 2]}]}, {"$var": "div"}]}, {"$var": "div"}]}]},
          {"$if": [{"$lt": [{"$var": "nv"}, {"$mul": [0.9, {"$var": "w"}]}]}, {"$add": [{"$var": "nv"}, {"$var": "div"}]}, {"$var": "nv"}]}]}]},
      {"$let": ["p", {"$cat": ["layer.", {"$var": "i"}, "."]},
      {"$let": ["body", [
          {"Conv": {"name": {"$cat": [{"$var": "p"}, "expand_1x1.convolution"]}, "cin": {"$var": "cin"}, "cout": {"$var": "ex"}, "k": 1, "stride": 1, "pad": 0, "bn": {"name": {"$cat": [{"$var": "p"}, "expand_1x1.normalization"]}, "eps": {"$var": "eps"}}, "act": {"$var": "act"}}},
          {"Conv": {"name": {"$cat": [{"$var": "p"}, "conv_3x3.convolution"]}, "cin": {"$var": "ex"}, "cout": {"$var": "ex"}, "k": 3, "stride": {"$var": "st"}, "pad": {"$if": [{"$var": "tfp"}, 0, 1]}, "tf_same": {"$var": "tfp"}, "groups": {"$var": "ex"}, "bn": {"name": {"$cat": [{"$var": "p"}, "conv_3x3.normalization"]}, "eps": {"$var": "eps"}}, "act": {"$var": "act"}}},
          {"Conv": {"name": {"$cat": [{"$var": "p"}, "reduce_1x1.convolution"]}, "cin": {"$var": "ex"}, "cout": {"$var": "cout"}, "k": 1, "stride": 1, "pad": 0, "bn": {"name": {"$cat": [{"$var": "p"}, "reduce_1x1.normalization"]}, "eps": {"$var": "eps"}}, "act": null}}
        ],
      {"$if": [{"$and": [{"$eq": [{"$var": "st"}, 1]}, {"$eq": [{"$var": "cin"}, {"$var": "cout"}]}]},
        [{"Residual": {"main": {"$var": "body"}, "shortcut": [], "act": null}}],
        {"$var": "body"}
      ]}]}]}]}]}]}]}
    ]}}},
    {"name": "tail", "value": [
      {"Conv": {"name": "conv_1x1.convolution", "cin": {"$index": [{"$var": "chs"}, 17]}, "cout": {"$var": "head"}, "k": 1, "stride": 1, "pad": 0, "bn": {"name": "conv_1x1.normalization", "eps": {"$var": "eps"}}, "act": {"$var": "act"}}}
    ]},
    {"name": "ops", "value": {"$concat": [{"$var": "stem"}, {"$var": "blocks"}, {"$var": "tail"}]}},
    {"name": "image", "value": {"$cfg": "image_size"}}
  ],
  "spec": {
    "architecture": {"$var": "arch"},
    "h": {"$if": [{"$is_list": {"$var": "image"}}, {"$index": [{"$var": "image"}, 0]}, {"$var": "image"}]},
    "w": {"$if": [{"$is_list": {"$var": "image"}}, {"$index": [{"$var": "image"}, 1]}, {"$var": "image"}]},
    "mean": [0.5, 0.5, 0.5], "std": [0.5, 0.5, 0.5],
    "ops": {"$var": "ops"},
    "out": "GlobalAvg",
    "ignored": {"$if": [{"$eq": [{"$var": "arch"}, "MobileNetV2ForImageClassification"]}, [], ["classifier."]]}, "head": {"$if": [{"$eq": [{"$var": "arch"}, "MobileNetV2ForImageClassification"]}, {"name": "classifier", "labels": {"$let": ["m", {"$cfg?": "id2label"}, {"$if": [{"$ne": [{"$var": "m"}, null]}, {"$len": {"$var": "m"}}, {"$cfg": ["num_labels", 2]}]}]}, "bias": true}, null]},
    "aliases": [["", "mobilenet_v2."]]
  }
}
